{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy 3D platformer where an important letter travels across ages and worlds - through living origami, purring cats, quests and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and the letter? That\u2019s you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/717c0d5a62a9507e80e353e7612e23e4.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all began in the Archive of Memory - a place of fading thoughts, unsent words, and letters that were never read.<br>Forgotten, but not lost, they sleep in endless drawers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them was one special letter. No one remembers who wrote it anymore, but inside was a strange spark. Enough for the paper to tremble\u2026 and awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, a Time Glitch flared up - and the letter vanished from the Archive.<br>Not stolen - escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere out there, the addressee is still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/d580abd1f61bf087c3d51eb2597c2720.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/50eb4bb73cebb8e3547def54577e6337.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origament is your cozy escape after a long day. Relaxing gameplay, light puzzles, stunning views, and a mysterious story. This isn\u2019t about challenge - it\u2019s about enjoying the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/fdf563bd5fe6c8be4e0ba06e4cc17c62.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/fdf563bd5fe6c8be4e0ba06e4cc17c62.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/fdf563bd5fe6c8be4e0ba06e4cc17c62.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/defec655e081af5f840ab33b8294dd79.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a paper boat drifting down a stream. A paper plane gliding through old Venice. Every world feels like a little meditation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b32e20cc87a5d741162f6b49720d8fed.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b32e20cc87a5d741162f6b49720d8fed.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/b32e20cc87a5d741162f6b49720d8fed.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/738b137c71480ac4ca55816069b92417.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=134 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level opens a new era, a new place, a new mood. The challenge doesn\u2019t come from enemies, but from the environment and its clever puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/4a080a6999e96ae71cdf5eb54e1d67a9.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/4a080a6999e96ae71cdf5eb54e1d67a9.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/4a080a6999e96ae71cdf5eb54e1d67a9.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/1dc21474c31924cc3fe5c8e3cfb0f3df.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change form to overcome obstacles. Every transformation means new physics, abilities, and vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/21506708b0c1b1dc3b3e9daaeb4d4e64.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=922 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/21506708b0c1b1dc3b3e9daaeb4d4e64.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/21506708b0c1b1dc3b3e9daaeb4d4e64.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/54a73286283531e130d977cb974bd584.avif?t=1756830444\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not about combat - it\u2019s about curiosity, observation, and clever adaptation. The levels themselves become both your biggest challenge - and your greatest ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3645184349eea36dcc7c1190423d1471.poster.avif?t=1756830444\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3645184349eea36dcc7c1190423d1471.webm?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3645184349eea36dcc7c1190423d1471.mp4?t=1756830444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448430?t=1756830444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756830444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/caa4